    "title": "Voice Recorder Sound Recorder",
    "description": "This is a very simple and practical high-quality Voice Recorder with a simple and clear interface.\r\nIf you need to record the current scene, you can quickly open Voice Recorder Sound Recorder and let it do its work, recording most high-quality sounds. You can also use Voice Recorder as a voice memo to record meaningful things in life, and you can record your mood anytime, anywhere, and record interviews, speeches, music, courses and other different scene types.\r\nIn the application, you can play and edit the recorded audio at will, and manage the recorded files in the application reasonably.\r\n\r\n\u26f3Voice Recorder Key features:\r\n\u2714High-quality Voice Recorder , record your most real voice, stable and clear.\r\n\u2714Long stable recording, record the sound you want most.\r\n\u2714Voice Recorder Supports multiple recording formats: AAC, M4A, MP3, etc.\r\n\u2714Voice Recorder Supports a variety of sound attributes: mono & stereo, which can make the sound more rhythmic and three-dimensional.\r\n\u2714Voice Recorder Supports adding markers while recording, making it easier to find out what's important in the recording.\r\n\u2714Voice Recorder Set the recorded audio as ringtone.\r\n\u2714Voice Recorder Set the cover of the recorded audio in the way you like and share it.\r\n\u2714Voice Recorder Customize and adjust the recording quality according to different recording quality requirements.\r\n\u2714By using the scene, select the debugged scene mode for audio recording, and provide the recording more professionally and intelligently.\r\n\r\nAnytime, anywhere, simple operation, you can record, come and use Voice Recorder Sound Recorder Voice Memos, Voice Recorder",
